                      "code": "\tpt \u003d (value.get(\u0027pType\u0027) or \u0027\u0027).capitalize() or u\u0027Root\u0027\n\tpp \u003d value.get(\u0027pPath\u0027) or \u0027(no path)\u0027\n\t# What we\u0027re adding next (child type)\n\tchild \u003d {\u0027\u0027:\u0027Enterprise\u0027,\u0027Enterprise\u0027:\u0027Site\u0027,\u0027Site\u0027:\u0027Area\u0027,\u0027Area\u0027:\u0027Line\u0027,\u0027Line\u0027:\u0027Cell\u0027,\u0027Group\u0027:\u0027Cell\u0027}.get(pt, \u0027Cell\u0027)\n\treturn \u0027Add {} Under: {}\u0027.format(child, pp)",
                      "type": "script"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "expr-struct"
                }
              }
